    <decisions>
        <name>Decision_AnyTeam</name>
        <label>Firm Has an Account Team?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>340</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_FirmOwner</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No team</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>HasTeam</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_ATMs</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Loop_ATMs</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has team</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Triage Cockpit routing v2 (per UAT feedback 21-Jul-2026): shows the FIRM's Account Team as a picker — the router chooses the recipient from a radio list of team members (office resolves via Ultimate_Account__c; when the PFC's account stamp is missing, e.g. records created already-closed, the Contact's own account is used). Falls back to the firm account owner with an explicit warning ONLY when no team exists. Posts a Chatter @mention on the record + creates a review Task for the recipient. Runs in system mode without sharing so reps reliably see team membership (read-only routing data; ATM-project precedent). PFC_Settings__mdt.Route_Preferred_Roles__c is reserved for a future default-selection enhancement.</description>
    <dynamicChoiceSets>
        <name>TeamUserChoices</name>
        <collectionReference>Get_Users</collectionReference>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <displayField>Name</displayField>
        <object>User</object>
        <valueField>Id</valueField>
    </dynamicChoiceSets>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>firmIdFormula</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Office.Ultimate_Account__c}), {!Get_Office.Id}, {!Get_Office.Ultimate_Account__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>officeIdFormula</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!Get_PFC.Account_Contact__c}), {!Get_Contact.AccountId}, {!Get_PFC.Account_Contact__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>taskDueDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
